<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13541" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό-πτωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>falling off</i> or <i>away,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀστέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mochl.</u>
					35
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					<u>Praef.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τῆς ἀρχῆς</span>”
				<i>deposition,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					12.530a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>direction in which a force is exerted,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				73.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>vanishing, disappearance, negation,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μηδαμῶς ὂν ἀ. ἐστι τοῦ ὄντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			; <i>eclipse,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ εἰδώλου</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				433
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>declension from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθήκοντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Chrysipp.Stoic.
					2.51
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				10.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				209
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς εὐσεβείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hierocl.
					<u>in CA</u>
					11p.442M.
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ ἀπόπτωσιν,</span> opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ κατόρθωσιν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Herm.
				<u>in Phdr.</u>
				p.166A.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
